00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.310 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  last month hackers breached gaming focus  blockchain platform ronin network an  ethereum compatible blockchain tailored  for the popular play to earn game  axionfinity the money stolen has been  valued at 600 million dollars making it  the second largest theft in crypto  history the hackers got away with 173  600 ether and 25 and a half million usdc  a digital asset pegged to the value of  the us dollar the u.s treasury  department has linked north korean  hacking group lazarus to this massive  theft  the lazarus cyber collective has  operated for more than 10 years with the  north korean government's blessing  gaining notoriety for its attack on sony  pictures in 2014 and an 81 million  dollar heist on the central bank of  bangladesh the group has managed to  launder 18 of the stolen funds as of  april 14th and continues to do so via  tornado cash a service that allows users  to obfuscate their digital trails  the hackers have been targeting crypto  entities since at least 2018 stealing  and laundering virtual currencies worth  in excess of 200 million dollars every  year a united nations report submitted  to the un security council sanctions  committee accused pyongyang of using  stolen funds from these attacks to  support its nuclear ballistic missiles  programs  until last year the majority of this  activity was directed towards  centralized cryptocurrency exchanges  located in south korea or elsewhere in  asia but in the past few months lazarus  has turned to decentralized financial  services like ronan by converting the  stolen cryptocurrencies at decentralized  exchanges the hackers avoided the  anti-money laundering and know your  customer checks performed at centralized  marketplaces and increasingly common  tactics seen in hacks of this type  blockchain intelligence firms including  chanalysis and elliptic continue their  investigations into the case ronan  announced they were working with  authorities and investigating the hack  on april 6 they also announced a 150  million dollar funding round led by  binance that will be used to reimburse  victims of the hack on friday the state  department's rewards for justice program  offered a reward of up to five million  dollars for information that would help  disrupt the flow of illicit funds to  north korea  [Music]  you

